*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Zyclone]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
